[agent-assisted] The developer wanted to make the Claude conversation history importer production-ready by adding noise filtering and validating that the extraction pipeline works on conversational input without prompt changes. A heuristic filter was added that reduces raw history volume by ~86% by keeping decisions, preferences, and personal facts while discarding coding commands and error logs, and an eval benchmark confirmed 100% filter accuracy and 95%+ entity/relationship recall on hand-curated test data. The `claude_miner` module itself was not tested against live history in an end-to-end run through the app, so real-world import quality under varied user history patterns remains unvalidated.
